            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Maybe they are merely broken?\r\n\r\nNo, they are not. They do what they are describing: put text and adjust indent. Try yanking line without indent and then `:normal! ]p` inside a text with indent (and surrounded by text without indent). Probably, needs 'smartindent' or something similar.\r\n\r\n> Shell prompt jumps are extremely frequent for and having a configurable way to jump between them would be very nice.\r\nI do also miss them very much in zellij.\r\n\r\nCould you please describe an example?",
